# Pawpatch Recruit: "Whenever a creature you control becomes the target of a spell ... an opponent controls" is one trigger for each creature (the ruling): Bot2's Kolaghan's
# Command destroys Bot1's Ornithopter and deals 2 damage to its Llanowar Elves, two different creatures, so the Recruit triggers twice and Bot1 puts both +1/+1 counters on the
# Recruit (4/3). Both creatures are still there when the abilities resolve above the Command.

